# Project core

- Expo Router app; keep `app/` thin. Business logic in `lib/`, `hooks/`, `components/`.
- Import via `@/` path alias.
- Navigate with `ROUTES` / `DEEP_LINKS` from `constants/routes.ts` only.
- Main tabs are exactly Home, Explore, Saved, Settings (`app/(main)/_layout.tsx`).
- AsyncStorage keys only through `constants/storage-keys.ts`.
- Do not commit unless the user asks. Prefer minimal diffs.
- Package/`scheme` spelling `bagavadgita` is intentional; UI copy uses “Bhagavad Gita”.
